      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُرَّادٌ</span></b>  <i>Cold and humid clouds in which is no
water:</i> (As:) or <i>cold and humid clouds which
the wind carries away;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُرَّيْدٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَرِيدٌ</span></b> :
(M:) or <i>thin clouds in which is no water;</i> (S,
K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُرَّيْدٌ</span></b>  (K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَرْدَى</span></b> . (L, TA.)

